@@ -8,3 +8,15 @@ and password-reset tokens. Standard library only.
 Money is `Decimal` dollars, rounded to cents half-up (`shop/money.py`).
 Shipping is a flat $7.95, free once the merchandise subtotal reaches $75.
 Sales tax is 8.25% of merchandise only; shipping is not taxed.
+
+Discount codes (`shop/discounts.py`) are entered with `Cart.apply_code`, are
+case-insensitive, and ignore surrounding whitespace. Only one code applies at a
+time; applying a new code replaces the old one. Codes:
+
+- `SAVE10`: 10% off the merchandise subtotal, rounded half-up to cents.
+- `FIVEOFF`: $5.00 off the merchandise subtotal.
+
+A discount is capped at the merchandise subtotal, so it never makes a total
+negative. Tax is charged on the subtotal after the discount. The free-shipping
+threshold ($75) is checked against the subtotal before the discount. Receipts
+show the discount as a `Discount (CODE)` row between Subtotal and Shipping.
